msgid "Environment Assets"
msgstr "环境资产"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:3
#: 00b53a89f6814d0bb591cda12e08964e
msgid ""
"USD environment and project scenes used with Isaac Sim. These trees are "
"siblings of `robots/`, not submodules of `robot_usds`."
msgstr "与 Isaac Sim 一起用的环境和项目场景 USD。这些树和 `robots/` 同级，不是 `robot_usds` 的子模块。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:5
#: d4c358f5ba73407997cdeead7336d817
msgid ""
"Robot models: [robot_usds](3-robot_usds.md). How to start Sim and open a "
"file: [Isaac Sim](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md). There is "
"no `./run.sh --env` flag; open the scene USD from `environment/` after "
"`./run.sh`."
msgstr "机器人模型见 [robot_usds](3-robot_usds.md)。如何启动 Sim 并打开文件见 [Isaac Sim](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)。没有 `./run.sh --env`；`./run.sh` 之后从 `environment/` 打开场景 USD。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:7
#: 65572fd2481e40fab84c26447dc5e247
msgid "Location in FaSim-Isaac"
msgstr "在 FaSim-Isaac 中："

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:9
#: af3efdd399f143e681075a111e728aa8
msgid ""
"FaSim-Isaac/\n"
"├── robots/                      # robot_usds\n"
"└── environment/\n"
"    ├── fiveages_env/            # → fiveages-env-usds\n"
"    ├── fa-project-usd/          # private project scenes\n"
"    ├── artvip-usd/              # ArtVIP components\n"
"    ├── labutopia-usd/           # LabUtopia components (private)\n"
"    └── ArtVIP/                  # official ArtVIP download (gitignore)"
msgstr "FaSim-Isaac/\n├── robots/                      # robot_usds\n└── environment/\n    ├── fiveages_env/            # → fiveages-env-usds\n    ├── fa-project-usd/          # 私有项目场景\n    ├── artvip-usd/              # ArtVIP 组件\n    ├── labutopia-usd/           # LabUtopia 组件（私有）\n    └── ArtVIP/                  # 官方 ArtVIP 下载（gitignore）\n"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:20
#: 304572ad8a1c4cc7a846ef6dbe664614
msgid ""
"Top-level URLs: [FaSim-Isaac `.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/FaSim-Isaac/blob/main/.gitmodules). `./init.sh` operation 1 uses "
"`submodules_visibility.conf`. As checked on 2026-11-13, `environment/fa-"
"project-usd` and `environment/labutopia-usd` are marked private "
"(unchecked until you have access). `environment/artvip-usd` is not listed"
" as private in that file, so operation 1 checks it with the other public-"
"marked items. The GitHub repository itself is still private; cloning it "
"needs access."
msgstr "顶层地址见 [FaSim-Isaac `.gitmodules`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac/blob/main/.gitmodules)。`./init.sh` 操作 1 使用 `submodules_visibility.conf`。以 2026-11-13 的核对为准，`environment/fa-project-usd` 和 `environment/labutopia-usd` 被标为私有（有权限之前不勾选）。`environment/artvip-usd` 没有在该文件里标成私有，所以操作 1 会把它和其他公开项一起勾上。GitHub 仓库本身仍是私有的，克隆需要权限。"

