#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:44
#: a0207f20731544e7bd38178248490137
msgid ""
"Internal project scenes. On `main`, a project is `scene.usd(a)`, "
"`objects/`, and a runnable `env/` ([README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/fa-project-usd/blob/main/README.md)). Projects may sit at the "
"repository root or under a customer or series directory."
msgstr ""
"用 `./run.sh` 打开该文件。在 `main` 上，一个项目是 `scene.usd(a)`、`objects/` 和 "
"`env/`（[README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-"
"usd/blob/main/README.md)）。`robot.yaml`、`task_configs/` 以及 `maps/` 或 "
"`map/` 在分支 `feature/sinopec-test-tube-picking` 上（领先 `main`，尚未合入）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:46
#: 742ac2cdcb9d4fb9ab52cfdf5496f3ba
msgid ""
"The files the orchestrator reads next to those scenes (`robot.yaml`, "
"`task_configs/`, and `maps/` or `map/`) are on branch `feature/sinopec-"
"test-tube-picking`. That branch was ahead of `main` and not merged when "
"these pages were checked on 2026-11-13. Three projects there use this "
"layout: `Fiveages/2026-11 Standard Moving Boxes`, `Siemens/2026-06 Wind "
"Turbine Blade Detection`, and `Aimbo/2026-04 Bosch German&Poland POC`. "
"You need access to open the branch."
msgstr "编排器在这些场景旁边读取的文件（`robot.yaml`、`task_configs/`，以及 `maps/` 或 `map/`）在分支 `feature/sinopec-test-tube-picking` 上。2026-11-13 核对这些页面时，该分支领先于 `main`，尚未合入。使用这种布局的项目有三个：`Fiveages/2026-11 Standard Moving Boxes`、`Siemens/2026-06 Wind Turbine Blade Detection`，以及 `Aimbo/2026-04 Bosch German&Poland POC`。打开该分支需要权限。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:48
#: eb2d5af888314ecb9759c935d29c2f68
msgid ""
"`NavigationLaunch` can point `map` at a `map.yaml` stored in that "
"project, as a path relative to the opened `env/` layer. The node itself "
"is documented under [FaSim-Isaac Navigation](2-fasim_isaac.md#navigation). The public way to run a project directory is [lerobot_ros2 "
"`examples/IsaacSim/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/main/examples/IsaacSim/README.md): `motion-"
"generation` with `LEROBOT_ROOT` set. Keep camera rigs in the scene USD."
msgstr "`NavigationLaunch` 可以把 `map` 指到该项目中的 `map.yaml`，路径相对于打开的 `env/` 层。节点本身写在 [FaSim-Isaac 导航](2-fasim_isaac.md#navigation)。公开的项目目录运行方式见 [lerobot_ros2 `examples/IsaacSim/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/main/examples/IsaacSim/README.md)：设置 `LEROBOT_ROOT` 后用 `motion-generation`。相机机位留在场景 USD 里。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:50
#: 0d8f84f05690413f8d971f5617619a0c
msgid "ArtVIP and LabUtopia"
msgstr "ArtVIP 与 LabUtopia"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:52
#: 4b3dc61372b948bf8a8d2627bba2bb0c
msgid ""
"`environment/artvip-usd` ([artvip-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/artvip-usd)) holds ArtVIP scene components that payload the official "
"dataset. `./init.sh` operation 3 downloads the official data into "
"`environment/ArtVIP/` with `tools/artvip_kitchen.py`. The FaSim README: "
"scene components stay in `artvip-usd`; the official data is not "
"committed."
msgstr "`environment/artvip-usd`（[artvip-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/artvip-usd)）存放 payload 官方数据集的 ArtVIP 场景组件。`./init.sh` 操作 3 用 `tools/artvip_kitchen.py` 把官方数据下到 `environment/ArtVIP/`。FaSim README：场景组件留在 `artvip-usd`，官方数据不入库。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:54
#: 0995e43013fd4fb19e34084dc9cf4552
msgid ""
"`environment/labutopia-usd` ([labutopia-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/labutopia-usd)) holds LabUtopia components. The repository is "
"private, and FaSim marks the submodule private."
msgstr "`environment/labutopia-usd`（[labutopia-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/labutopia-usd)）存放 LabUtopia 组件。仓库是私有的，FaSim 也把该子模块标为私有。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:56
#: 294d29d4a70e4e4d8a26ebd96b48e341
msgid "Creating a custom scene"
msgstr "创建自定义场景"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:58
#: 7537c82870a543f9b87998906ac66e20
msgid "Create the USD scene in Isaac Sim."
msgstr "在 Isaac Sim 里创建 USD 场景。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:59
#: ec5a15f5c3c64f648925ba43f91d6282
msgid ""
"Put it under `environment/fiveages_env/` or, with access, under [fa-"
"project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) using the "
"`scene` / `objects` / `env` layout on `main`."
msgstr "放到 `environment/fiveages_env/`，或有权限时放到 [fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd)，并使用 `main` 上的 `scene` / `objects` / `env` 布局。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/5-env_assets.md:60
#: 32f2b8c2b3084d4d83747da9d0d7e7f9
msgid "Open that file from `./run.sh`."
msgstr "用 `./run.sh` 打开那份文件。"

